[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2481642124","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99372#issuecomment-2481642124","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99372","id":2481642124,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6T6tqM","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-17T22:38:35Z","updated_at":"2024-11-17T22:38:35Z","body":"Thank you for the PR!\r\n\r\nSorry for not looking into this before, I somehow missed that issue :sweat_smile:\r\n\r\nNothing in the spec seems to explicitly report this and I don't think I've ever noticed this behavior in sway, so I think that it might be some ambiguity in how the protocol's described.\r\n\r\nMy theory is that my executing [`wl_data_device::set_selection`](https://wayland.app/protocols/wayland#wl_data_device:request:set_selection) each time, the compositor \"replaces\" the current source and sends a cancelled event, which in turn destroys itself.\r\n\r\nI think that the proper solution might be to avoid calling it if we already have a valid source, since it will be destroyed if something else replaces it.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2481642124/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2481660955","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99372#issuecomment-2481660955","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99372","id":2481660955,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6T6yQb","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-17T22:59:29Z","updated_at":"2024-11-17T22:59:44Z","body":"Code checks out! Note that you accidentally left a bunch of tabs in one line, before the `TODO` comment, making the CI fail:\r\n![formatted diff showing the whitespace](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2c7c1d91-2b1c-4f2e-9fb9-fc4db0326186)\r\n\r\n(Uploaded a pic because I have no idea how to highlight that through markdown)\r\n\r\nI'll formally approv